以后他要是有困难 你就成他上面的人了
the next time he needs something, you are the guy.

347
00:13:49,651 --> 00:13:51,290
妈妈咪呀 你是不是也带他去了
Ay, Dios mo. Did you took him with you?

348
00:13:51,290 --> 00:13:52,831
忍到学校再打瞌睡会死吗
You couldn't wait to get to school to do that?

349
00:13:52,831 --> 00:13:55,091
曼尼 跟我去上学
Manny, vamonos para el colegio.

350
00:13:55,091 --> 00:13:57,065
快走 今天迟大发了 快去学校
Let's go. We're gonna be so late. Vamonos.

351
00:13:57,130 --> 00:13:59,270
我们得迟到了 曼尼
Vamos a llegar tardsimo, Manny,

352
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:00,854
磨叽什么呢 快上车
qu te pasa? Get in the car.

353
00:14:00,910 --> 00:14:03,750
我记得你说过 要我好好跟哈维尔相处的啊
I thought you said you wanted me to bond with Javier.

354
00:14:04,330 --> 00:14:06,150
我说让你友好点
I said be nice, Jay.

355
00:14:06,150 --> 00:14:08,910
没说让你们带着曼尼刷夜打球啊
I didn't say take Manny up all night and play games.

356
00:14:09,046 --> 00:14:12,416
-我们还吃了热狗哦 -给老娘睡觉去
- Then we got hot dogs. - Ay. Go to sleep!

357
00:14:12,490 --> 00:14:13,930
我要是想要一个疯狂的男人
If I wanted to be married to a wild man,

358
00:14:14,590 --> 00:14:15,890
我就不会离开哈维尔了
I would have stayed with Javier.

359
00:14:18,090 --> 00:14:18,690
什么情况啊
Qu pasa?

360
00:14:18,795 --> 00:14:21,081
-老爸 -我的天呐 不是吧
- Dad! - Por dios, no.

361
00:14:21,170 --> 00:14:21,930
搞什么鬼
What the hell?

362
00:14:25,910 --> 00:14:26,390
等一下
Wait a minute.

363
00:14:26,390 --> 00:14:28,310
-你们该不是要走了吧 -我得去上学
- You're not leaving, are you? - I've got school.

364
00:14:28,530 --> 00:14:30,710
-什么上学 -是的 上学
- What? School? - Yes, school.

365
00:14:30,750 --> 00:14:32,490
人们去学校是要学知识的
That's where people go to learn things,

366
00:14:32,490 --> 00:14:34,270
比如说别带着小孩子刷夜
like not to keep children up all night.

367
00:14:34,570 --> 00:14:36,150
-他招了吗 -他弱爆了
- He told her? - He's weak.

368
00:14:36,570 --> 00:14:39,750
听着 你说你曾经喜欢骑摩托车 对吧
Well, listen, you said you used to like riding motorcycles, right?

369
00:14:39,870 --> 00:14:40,630
所以我给你带了一辆
So I brought you one.

370
00:14:40,650 --> 00:14:43,310
-我知道 但我得工作 -工作毛啊
- I know. But I kind of got work. - Work.

371
00:14:43,470 --> 00:14:44,690
-上吧 杰 -对啊 上吧
- Go, Jay. - Yeah, go.

372
00:14:44,830 --> 00:14:47,670
对啊 杰 把曼尼也带上吧
Yes, go, Jay, and take Manny with you too!

373
00:14:48,138 --> 00:14:48,920
好啊
Okay.

374
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:49,770
不 曼尼尔·阿尔伯特
No, Manuel Alberto!

375
00:14:49,770 --> 00:14:51,850
上车 不然老娘把你塞到后备箱里
In the car or I put you in the trunk!

376
00:14:52,926 --> 00:14:55,112
杰 我不跟你争了
Jay, I'm not gonna argue anymore.

377
00:14:55,190 --> 00:14:57,730
我不多嘴了 你随意吧
I'm not gonna say anything else. Do whatever you want.

378
00:14:57,806 --> 00:15:01,565
但别让老娘再听到你抱怨哥伦比亚人疯狂
But I don't wanna hear you any more saying that Colombians are crazy,

379
00:15:01,565 --> 00:15:03,254
因为跟你比起来我们弱爆了
'cause you're the one that is acting crazy,

380
00:15:03,690 --> 00:15:05,630
虽然说你是被他带疯的
even though he's the one that is making you act crazy.

381
00:15:05,693 --> 00:15:07,674
我也不知道自己在说神马 曼尼
So I don't know what the hell I'm talking about! Manny!

382
00:15:15,170 --> 00:15:16,970
你没必要在她午睡时回来的
You didn't need to come home during nap time.

383
00:15:17,930 --> 00:15:19,690
昨晚的事证明我十分有必要回来
Think we proved last night that I did.

384
00:15:20,130 --> 00:15:21,790
好吧 她就在后面 你走吧
Well, she's back there now, so why don't you go,

385
00:15:21,790 --> 00:15:22,750
我担心老板找你麻烦
so you don't get in trouble.

386
00:15:22,879 --> 00:15:24,530
没事的 我跟大家说
That's okay. I told everyone

387
00:15:24,530 --> 00:15:26,110
我找了个不可靠的伴侣
that I have an unreliable partner,

388
00:15:26,191 --> 00:15:28,910
然后 他们表示理解
and, uh, they understood.

389
00:15:28,910 --> 00:15:30,950
你知道不 我才不要在这里被冷嘲热讽
You know what? I don't need to sit here and be condescended to.

390
00:15:30,950 --> 00:15:33,166
我去弄杯冰红茶
I'm gonna make myself an ice tea.

391
00:15:33,770 --> 00:15:35,090
信不信我抽你
I will bring you down.

392
00:15:35,890 --> 00:15:36,870
就你 别逗了
You can't bring me down.

393
00:15:37,170 --> 00:15:38,310
我会扫堂腿
I'll sweep your legs.

394
00:15:41,070 --> 00:15:42,130
你绝对不是正常人
There's something wrong with you...

395
00:15:42,199 --> 00:15:43,630
我们家闺女如此痛苦抑郁地哭喊
that the sound of our child in such distress

396
00:15:43,630 --> 00:15:44,417
居然扰不了你半根神经
doesn't bother you more.

397
00:15:44,417 --> 00:15:45,710
她才不抑郁呢 而且
She's not in distress,

398
00:15:45,710 --> 00:15:48,290
此事恰恰证明 你比她更需要费伯睡眠法
and this just proves that you need this more than she does.

399
00:15:48,364 --> 00:15:50,048
我得用此法锻炼两个宝宝
I'm Ferberizing two babies.

400
00:15:50,048 --> 00:15:52,028
前几天有浣熊溜进劳森家
Raccoons slipped into the lawsons' home

401
00:15:52,028 --> 00:15:53,193
偷了一长条面包
and stole a loaf of bread.

402
00:15:54,770 --> 00:15:55,625
你想说什么
Your point?

403
00:15:55,625 --> 00:15:57,479
你想想 莉莉房间窗户开了道缝
That we left Lily's window open a crack,

404
00:15:57,550 --> 00:15:59,550
浣熊要找些小菜做个三明治
and those raccoons need something to put between that bread,

405
00:15:59,710 --> 00:16:01,190
然后莉莉就哭着喊救命了
and that is Lily's "Help me" Cry.

406
00:16:01,278 --> 00:16:02,899
-熊妈妈来救你了 莉莉 -你敢
- I'm coming for you, Lily. - No, you're not.

407
00:16:02,988 --> 00:16:03,638
你不准去 卡梅隆
You are not coming, Cameron.

408
00:16:03,638 --> 00:16:05,613
让我去 嘿 你撒手
Let me go! Hey, stop it!

409
00:16:05,661 --> 00:16:07,484
放开我 下来 你干什么
Let go! Get off me! What are you doing?

410
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:09,097
-停下 -我不停
- Stop! - I will not stop.

411
00:16:09,178 --> 00:16:11,337
别淘气了 宝宝我来了
Stop being such a baby. I'm coming for you!

412
00:16:13,770 --> 00:16:17,710
-咋了 -脚崴了
- What? - Oh, my ankle.

413
00:16:18,430 --> 00:16:18,830
脚崴了
My ankle.

414
00:16:26,610 --> 00:16:30,030
我还以为你会从摩托车上摔死呢
Ay! I guess you didn't kill yourself in the motorcycle today.

415
00:16:30,210 --> 00:16:32,110
我知道你恨不得亲手杀了我
Well, I figured you were looking forward to killing me,

416
00:16:32,168 --> 00:16:33,763
我怎么能驾车归西 让你愿望落空呢
so I'm not gonna take that away from you.

417
00:16:35,010 --> 00:16:36,350
那个 哈维尔打给你了没
Hey, did Javier call you?

418
00:16:36,830 --> 00:16:37,430
没有啊 怎么了
No, why?

419
00:16:37,550 --> 00:16:40,390
他要拉我去酒吧会会他的老球友
He's dragging me to this bar with some of his old baseball pals.

420
00:16:40,454 --> 00:16:42,621
说好5点这边见的
He was supposed to be here at 5:00.

421
00:16:42,739 --> 00:16:43,984
-他拉着你啊 -没错
- Ah, he's dragging you, huh? - Yeah.

422
00:16:43,984 --> 00:16:45,110
我觉得没什么不妥的
I figured it would be okay.

423
00:16:45,110 --> 00:16:46,370
我见识过当中一半的人打比赛
I've seen half these guys play.

424
00:16:46,790 --> 00:16:48,210
哈维尔说没什么
Javier says it's cool.

425
00:16:49,910 --> 00:16:51,890
-你笑什么 -没什么
- What? What's the joke? - Nothing.

426
00:16:52,490 --> 00:16:54,870
真好笑 你之前还笑话我
It's just funny to me... that you make fun of me

427
00:16:54,870 --> 00:16:56,370
怎么会被他那样的人勾去了魂
because I was seduced by him,

428
00:16:56,370 --> 00:16:57,350
但你现在...
but here you are-

429
00:16:57,350 --> 00:16:59,130
我才没有被他勾去了魂
No one is getting seduced.

430
00:16:59,930 --> 00:17:01,210
我这么做都是为了曼尼
I'm doing this for Manny.

431
00:17:01,830 --> 00:17:03,330
对哦 你们俩去山上浪漫地野餐
Yeah, it's very important for Manny

432
00:17:03,330 --> 00:17:06,530
对曼尼来说是多么滴重要啊
that you two go and have a nice picnic in the mountains.

433
00:17:06,590 --> 00:17:08,550
首先 那不叫野餐 就喝了杯咖啡
First of all, it wasn't a picnic. We stopped for coffee.

434
00:17:08,850 --> 00:17:10,690
碰巧那儿有卖煎饼果子的
They just happened to be selling crepes.

435
00:17:10,755 --> 00:17:13,553
听着 他打来知会我一声 好吗
Listen. Let me know when he calls, all right?

436
00:17:13,618 --> 00:17:16,045
天呐 眨眼就6点了
Geez, it's almost 6:00.

437
00:17:18,930 --> 00:17:21,170
孩子们都盼着你回家呢
The kids are so excited for you to come home.

438
00:17:21,230 --> 00:17:21,830
我也想他们了
Oh, me too.

439
00:17:21,930 --> 00:17:23,470
对了 卢克还给你做了个标语呢
Yeah, Luke made you a sign.

440
00:17:23,610 --> 00:17:28,010
-他最贴心了 -你看上去气色挺好的
- Oh, he's a sweetie. - Yeah. You seem great.

441
00:17:28,130 --> 00:17:30,424
-确实感觉不错 -那就好
- I am great. - Good.

442
00:17:30,490 --> 00:17:31,970
除了消防员那事
Except for that fireman thing.

443
00:17:32,073 --> 00:17:33,113
-你还记着呢 -必须的
- You remember it? - Mm-hmm.

444
00:17:33,113 --> 00:17:37,768
-好吧 对不起 -没事啦
- Yeah, okay. Look, I am sorry. I'm so sorry. - Ah, no.

445
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:39,190
都是我的错 没有借口
There's no excuse for it.

446
00:17:40,110 --> 00:17:43,310
我一家庭妇女 每天邋里邋遢
I think I just spend so much time in dowdy mom clothes,

447
00:17:43,330 --> 00:17:45,850
身上都是面粉和花生酱
and I'm covered in paste and peanut butter,

448
00:17:45,850 --> 00:17:50,030
我只想偶尔能散发点魅力 懂吗
and I just- I wanted to feel attractive for a second, you know?

449
00:17:51,310 --> 00:17:52,730
对不起 我真的
I'm sorry. I really-

450
00:17:53,030 --> 00:17:56,630
亲爱的 再给我点时间释怀
Honey, I just need a little bit of time.

451
00:17:57,090 --> 00:17:58,790
-我会没事的 -好吧
- Gonna be fine. - Okay.

452
00:17:58,917 --> 00:18:01,149
-恩 -好吧
- Yeah. - Okay.

453
00:18:01,230 --> 00:18:02,490
我早就想开了
I was already fine with it.

454
00:18:02,610 --> 00:18:04,050
哥在下一盘很大的棋 克莱尔搞砸了
Here's the deal: Claire messed up.

455
00:18:04,090 --> 00:18:04,850
她欠我的
She owed me.

456
00:18:05,230 --> 00:18:07,070
千年难得一遇的好事
This never happens.

457
00:18:08,530 --> 00:18:10,130
老菲尔金牌在手啦
Old Phil has a golden ticket.

458
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:13,490
现在 我可以立刻兑换些小恩惠
Now, I could have cashed that in right away for something small-

459
00:18:13,490 --> 00:18:16,090
不用打扫车库 去参加一周马戏团夏令营之类的
get out of cleaning the garage, a week at circus camp.

460
00:18:16,370 --> 00:18:17,630
-记忆犹新 -知道
- Still fresh. - Yeah.

461
00:18:18,690 --> 00:18:22,690
但是拖得越久 她愧疚感越多
But the longer you hold on to it, the more the guilt builds,

462
00:18:23,350 --> 00:18:24,550
哥得到的也就越多
the more you get.

463
00:18:24,550 --> 00:18:28,310
拖五年 和弟兄们去巴黎旅行
Five years: Trip to Paris with my buddies.

464
00:18:29,410 --> 00:18:32,010
拖十年 漂亮的敞篷车
Ten years: Sweet little convertible.

465
00:18:33,210 --> 00:18:34,210
拖二十年
Twenty years:

466
00:18:34,890 --> 00:18:38,710
你好啊 语言表达清晰 全功能的机器人
Hello, fully articulating, five-function robot...

467
00:18:38,710 --> 00:18:42,910
能读懂我的思想 有自主感觉
that can read my mind and has feelings.

468
00:18:43,689 --> 00:18:47,202
菲尔 你不是打算不辞而别吧
Phil, you're not leaving without saying good-bye, are you?

469
00:18:47,270 --> 00:18:48,210
嘿 伊莱恩
Hey, Elaine.

470
00:18:48,370 --> 00:18:50,170
-他是你老公吗 -是啊
- Is this your husband? - Uh-huh.

471
00:18:50,404 --> 00:18:52,630
-再见了 巴黎 -我来探望我姐姐
- Good-bye, Paris. - I'm visiting my sister...

472
00:18:52,630 --> 00:18:55,470
他一下午就在那玩魔术牌逗我们开心
and he was entertaining us all afternoon with his card tricks.

473
00:18:55,510 --> 00:18:58,150
-菲尔来啦 -嘿
- Is that Phil? - Hey.

474
00:19:00,830 --> 00:19:03,230
妈 菲尔这就走了
Hey, Mom, Phil's leaving.

475
00:19:03,230 --> 00:19:07,110
-不跟我抱抱吗 -一波又一波啊
- Without a hug? - Wow.

476
00:19:07,170 --> 00:19:09,622
再见了 语言表达清晰
Good-bye, fully articulating,

477
00:19:09,683 --> 00:19:13,180
全功能的 会说"再见"的机器人
five-function robot with the ability to- Good-bye.

478
00:19:13,250 --> 00:19:14,930
布兰妮 快点宝贝儿 菲尔走了
Brittany, hurry, honey. Phil's leaving.

479
00:19:16,150 --> 00:19:16,850
你没事的
You're fine.

480
00:19:20,510 --> 00:19:23,050
-脚踝还疼吗 -拔凉的
- How's your ankle? - It's cold.

481
00:19:23,490 --> 00:19:26,290
-对不起害你受伤 -别 别这样
- I'm sorry I hurt you. - No. No, don't be. I-

482
00:19:28,010 --> 00:19:29,930
我也可能轻易伤到你的
I could have just as easily hurt you.

483
00:19:30,810 --> 00:19:32,510
好吧 你倒是挺大言不惭的
Well, it's cute that you think that.

484
00:19:34,210 --> 00:19:37,110
听着 小卡 我不想一直唱白脸
Listen, Cam, I- I can't always be the bad cop here.

485
00:19:37,194 --> 00:19:38,770
我知道自己很严格
I-I know it's my issue,

486
00:19:38,770 --> 00:19:40,130
但是我不希望她成长的过程中
but she can't grow up with

487
00:19:40,130 --> 00:19:42,230
你一直是那个胸襟宽广 温暖可人的爸爸
one huggy, happy, cuddly dad...

488
00:19:42,230 --> 00:19:45,870
我却是那个死板严肃 满嘴教条的爸爸
and one frowny, lesson-teachy dad.

489
00:19:45,970 --> 00:19:47,970
因为我们也不知道
Because guess which one

490
00:19:47,970 --> 00:19:50,430
她最后会选谁陪她走婚礼红毯
she's gonna ask to walk her down the aisle.

491
00:19:53,741 --> 00:19:55,999
你说得对 这样吧
Uh- Y- Okay, you know what?

492
00:19:56,070 --> 00:19:57,610
我也可以适时唱唱白脸的
I can be the bad cop sometimes.

493
00:19:58,790 --> 00:20:00,650
让她吃蔬菜的任务就交给我吧
I'll always make her eat her vegetables.

494
00:20:01,790 --> 00:20:03,250
-行 看牙医也交给你 -成交
- Okay. Dentist. - Deal.

495
00:20:03,490 --> 00:20:05,870
-好的 -只要你逼她练小提琴
- Good. - As long as you make her practice her violin.

496
00:20:06,850 --> 00:20:08,370
对了 小提琴 我喜欢
Oh, yeah. The violin. I like that.

497
00:20:09,290 --> 00:20:11,410
还有 到时候我们一起伴着她走红毯
And we're both walking her down the aisle.

498
00:20:12,530 --> 00:20:14,130
如果你到时候还能走路的话
Assuming you can walk by then.

499
00:20:14,850 --> 00:20:16,430
要去医院看看吗
Do you need to go to the hospital for that?

500
00:20:16,430 --> 00:20:19,632
不了 妈呀 不了 没那么严重
No, God. No, no. It's not that bad.

501
00:20:19,701 --> 00:20:21,375
你的意思是打911吧
Oh, you meant call 911, didn't you?

502
00:20:21,375 --> 00:20:22,540
性感消防员哦
Firemen.

503
00:20:22,540 --> 00:20:25,556
快打电话 我换件衣服去
Yeah, you call, and I'm gonna change my shirt.

504
00:20:26,750 --> 00:20:29,090
那么 如果要我有点大人样
So, if I'm supposed to act like an adult,

505
00:20:29,790 --> 00:20:32,250
是让我像世上正常的大人那样
is that act like adults I see in the world-

506
00:20:34,110 --> 00:20:36,010
还是像家里的这些大人
Or the adults in my family?

507
00:20:39,329 --> 00:20:43,648
如果要我像家里的大人一样
'Cause if it's the ones in my family-

508
00:20:43,770 --> 00:20:45,930
-走吧 回去吧 -好的
- Come on. Let's go. - All right.

509
00:20:49,630 --> 00:20:50,110
那么...
Then...

510
00:20:50,110 --> 00:20:51,810
也没什么难的
how hard could that be?

511
00:20:56,990 --> 00:20:58,570
在医院里玩的纸牌魔术
Doing the card tricks at the hospital

512
00:20:58,570 --> 00:21:01,070
重燃了我的魔术之火
really got me fired up about my magic again.

513
00:21:03,110 --> 00:21:04,550
这是你刚刚那张牌吗
Is this your card?

514
00:21:05,510 --> 00:21:06,890
没错 你真牛
Yes. Oh, my gosh.

515
00:21:06,959 --> 00:21:08,869
其实 并不是吧
It's- It's not, is it?

516
00:21:08,939 --> 00:21:11,381
不是 真不是
No, uh, no. It's not.

517
00:21:11,450 --> 00:21:13,590
最虐心的就是对方自己都忘了是哪张牌
The hardest part is when people forget their card,

518
00:21:13,610 --> 00:21:15,030
因为那样就显得我像个傻瓜
because then I look like the idiot.

519
00:21:15,430 --> 00:21:17,650
-好吧 再玩一次 -我们真得走了
- All right. Let's do it again. - We really have to go.

520
00:21:17,910 --> 00:21:18,965
-你以为我喜欢这样吗 -抱歉
- You think I like this? - I'm sorry.

521
00:21:18,965 --> 00:21:21,324
来 哥教你一招好吗
Here. I'm gonna teach you one, okay?

522
00:21:21,410 --> 00:21:23,030
数到三你就抓住这个 准备好了吗
On the count of three, just grab this. You ready?

523
00:21:23,102 --> 00:21:25,418
-把手伸出来 -好的
- Put your hand out. - Okay.

524
00:21:25,490 --> 00:21:27,590
一 二 三 走你
One, two, three. There it is.

525
00:21:28,010 --> 00:21:29,530
不是吧 这整哪出啊
No. What was that?

526
00:21:29,730 --> 00:21:30,950
谢谢配合
Thank you.

527
00:21:31,850 --> 00:21:32,690
拿我当猴耍呢
Are you kidding me?
